# examples/asn1/frag.asn1: random values against pycrate, asn1c and rasn (no hand vectors;
# examples/src/bin/frag.rs checks encodings by hand). rasn 0.28 misreads fragmented
# lengths and large fixed BIT STRINGs (tests/x691/README.md).
# asn1c rejects a fragmented SEQUENCE OF (16K components or more), as in tests/x691 sizes.
deviates rasn BigBits
deviates rasn BigList
deviates rasn Ext
deviates rasn ExtList
deviates rasn FixedBig
deviates rasn NibbleList
deviates asn1c BigList
deviates asn1c ExtList
